## Optimal

### Frequency counting

```
O(n)
```

where `n` is the length of `word`.

### Sorting

The frequency array has a fixed size of **26**. Sorting it is:

```
O(26 log 26)
```

Since 26 is a constant, this is effectively **O(1)**.

### Final loop

```
O(26)
```

Also constant.

### Total Time

```
O(n) + O(1) + O(1)

= O(n)
```

### Space

The frequency array always has 26 elements:

```
O(26) = O(1)
```

